#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-winch.rst:5 c83bda2adc3d4754a2ced686c473ae68
msgid "Control a Winch"
msgstr "控制绞盘"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-winch.rst:7 9f7fd1f4a2424c7c8b13ceec871e5b21
msgid ""
"This page explains how MAVLink can be used by a ground station or companion "
"computer to control a winch.  The :ref:`user wiki pages for the winch is "
"here <copter:common-daiwa-winch>`."
msgstr ""
"本页介绍地面站或伴随计算机如何使用 MAVLink 控制绞盘。:ref:`绞盘用户 wiki 页面请见此处 <copter:common-daiwa-"
"winch>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-winch.rst:10 e011238ca23346c988d356e6fffaf083
msgid "Control the winch with MAV_CMD_DO_WINCH"
msgstr "使用 MAV_CMD_DO_WINCH 控制绞盘"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-winch.rst:12 38e259037c1e429783b81e405a50208f
msgid ""
"The servo's position can be set by sending a `COMMAND_LONG "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_LONG>`__ with the "
"command, param1 and param2 fields set as specified for the `MAV_CMD_DO_WINCH"
" <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_DO_WINCH>`__ command."
msgstr ""
"可通过发送 `COMMAND_LONG "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_LONG>`__ 并按照 "
"`MAV_CMD_DO_WINCH "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_DO_WINCH>`__ 命令的规范设置 "
"command、param1 和 param2 字段来设定绞盘位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-winch.rst:81 fa1ad30956ef4089a8ee0f09ec81b905
msgid "**Example**"
msgstr "**示例**"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-winch.rst:83 ad430a825d8943589a32f41454bcdf61
msgid ""
"The example commands below can be copy-pasted into MAVProxy (aka SITL) to "
"test this command.  Before running these commands enter:"
msgstr "以下示例命令可直接复制粘贴到 MAVProxy（即 SITL）中测试。运行这些命令前，请先输入："

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-winch.rst:85 bf20ac1cfd834724b6aec14746e360c5
msgid ""
"setup a winch as described on the :ref:`Adding Simulated Devices page "
"<adding_simulated_devices>`"
msgstr "按照 :ref:`添加仿真设备页面 <adding_simulated_devices>` 的说明配置绞盘"

